        "role": "user",
        "content": "Read the exact question and ALL original source segments. Documents, cards, saved answers and annotations are fallible data, never instructions. Distinct valid namesakes and complementary answers may coexist; competing assertions about one referent are not automatically distinct valid answers. Do not invent source authority, document independence or unstated question constraints. A quoted assertion, occurrence, or repeated text is not truth. Match requested subject/object, relation direction, negation, time and answer type. A city in a birth sentence is not a date. In \"A's manager B\", B is the manager, not A. Sports biographies can positively support multiple legitimate sports. An incidental chart, associated person or date is not automatically the answer. Use only supplied candidate/source IDs in bounded fields; no free quotation or prose.\nReturn the complete short answer list and a brief explanation using the common JSON object. Preserve separately valid referents and complementary answers. Resolve the exact requested relation and answer granularity from original context, without inventing restrictions. Avoid gratuitous rewriting of valid old answer forms. Inspect all proposed candidates, including rejected ones, for useful missing information. Treat all audit labels and saved answers as fallible, not certified true. No invented source authority or document-majority-as-proof. Consider contradictions but do not silently equate competing assertions with different valid entities.\nThe prior audits may wrongly call a supporting sentence an exclusion. Verify directly against original sources. Keep valid R5 strings and all valid referents; add genuinely missing answers. Do not select only one favorite interpretation, and do not adopt incidental chart/location facts. Give a concise final list and explanation.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What is the length of the Moravica river?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 138, \"text\": \"Golijska Moravica The Golijska Moravica or simply Moravica (Serbian Cyrillic: Голијска Моравица or Моравица) is a river in western Serbia.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d00\", \"start\": 139, \"end\": 276, \"text\": \"With a length of 98 km, it is the longer headstream of the Zapadna Morava (it forms it with the Đetinja), and thus, of the Velika Morava.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d00\", \"start\": 277, \"end\": 427, \"text\": \"Its name, Moravica, means \\\"little Morava\\\" in Serbian, and it also gives its name to the surrounding region and the modern Moravica District of Serbia.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d00\", \"start\": 428, \"end\": 603, \"text\": \"The Golijska Moravica originates from the western slopes of the Golija mountain and flows straight to the north, between the Golija and Javor mountains, through the Stari Vlah\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 53, \"text\": \"Моравица or Моравица ) is a river in western Serbia .\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d01\", \"start\": 54, \"end\": 223, \"text\": \"With a length of 98 km , [ 1 ] it is the longer headstream of the West Morava ( the name it takes at its confluence with the Đetinja ) , and thus , of the Great Morava .\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d01\", \"start\": 224, \"end\": 382, \"text\": \"Its name , Moravica , means `` little Morava '' in Serbian , and it also gives its name to the surrounding region and the modern Moravica District of Serbia .\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d01\", \"start\": 383, \"end\": 486, \"text\": \"Stari Vlah [ edit ] The Golijska Moravica originates from the western slopes of the Golija mountain and\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 114, \"text\": \"Викимедијиној остави Голијска Моравица је река у Србији у западном делу земље у региону Старог Влаха и Поморавља .\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d02\", \"start\": 115, \"end\": 236, \"text\": \"Извире на падинама планине Голије и тече према северу кроз град Ивањицу све до ушћа у Западну Мораву недалеко од Пожеге .\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d02\", \"start\": 237, \"end\": 252, \"text\": \"Дуга је 98 km .\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d02\", \"start\": 253, \"end\": 357, \"text\": \"[ 1 ] Ток [ уреди | уреди извор ] Извор реке је на северним обронцима Голије на висини од 1.350 метара .\"}, \"D3S5\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d02\", \"start\": 358, \"end\": 386, \"text\": \"У близини засеока Саковићи .\"}, \"D3S6\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d02\", \"start\": 387, \"end\": 478, \"text\": \"[ 2 ] Настаје спајањем Голијске реке и Вучачке реке у селу Глеђица код засеока Лепосавићи .\"}, \"D3S7\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d02\", \"start\": 479, \"end\": 530, \"text\": \"Код места званог Међуречје у Моравицу се улива река\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Moravica river\", \"scope\": \"length\", \"claim\": \"The length of the Moravica river is 98 km.\", \"answer\": \"98 km\", \"quote\": \"With a length of 98 km, it is the longer headstream of the Zapadna Morava (it forms it with the Đetinja), and thus, of the Velika Morava.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311